  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議なりんご。とにかく　蜜入り。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "어느 특정 포켓몬을 진화시키는 이상한 사과. 엄청나게 꿀맛이다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓特定寶可夢進化的神奇蘋果。富含蜜汁。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pomme mystérieuse pleine de nectar qui permet de faire évoluer une certaine espèce de Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieser sonderbare Apfel löst bei einem bestimmten Pokémon die Entwicklung aus. Er ist sehr saftig.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curiosa manzana, de sabor particularmente meloso, que hace evolucionar a una determinada especie de Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mela particolare, ricca di una sostanza simile a sciroppo, che fa evolvere determinate specie di Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A peculiar apple that can make a certain species of Pokémon evolve. It’s exceptionally syrupy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議なりんご。とにかく　蜜入り。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这种神奇的苹果可以使特定的宝可梦进化。富含蜜汁。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
